# L §5.15: crps(x[i] for i in I, y) = (1/n) Σ|x_i - y| - (1/(2n^2)) ΣΣ|x_i - x_j|, exact.  x = (1, 3), y = 2:
# (1 + 1)/2 - (0 + 2 + 2 + 0)/8 = 0.5.  Weighted, ŵ = (1/4, 3/4): Σŵ|x - y| = 1, ½ ΣΣ ŵŵ|x_i - x_j| = ½ × 2 × 3/16 × 2
# = 3/8, so 1 - 3/8 = 0.625.  The ask reaches crps, so it states orient (printed).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index is2 = [i1, i2]
input x[i in is2]: num
input wt[i in is2]: num
input y: num
def cs: num = crps(x[i] for i in is2, y) at reader
def cw: num = crps(x[i] weight wt[i] for i in is2, y) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  x[i1] = 1
  x[i2] = 3
  wt[i1] = 1
  wt[i2] = 3
  y = 2

ask a: cs, cw law 2026-06-30 orient lower
=== expect
a: (0.5, 0.625)
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
  orient lower
